{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your first shift in <i>After Hours: Library</i> with this one-hour demo. Work as the new night librarian inside a grand old library once owned by a wealthy collector, now shrouded in silence and something far more sinister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-Hour Preview</strong> \u2013 Survive a full shift designed to showcase the core gameplay loop.<br><strong>Choose Your Character</strong> \u2013 Play as either a male or female librarian, each with their own personality.<br><strong>Stealth &amp; Survival</strong> \u2013 Evade a relentless monster that reacts to sound, light, and movement.<br><strong>Main Floor Access</strong> \u2013 Explore the vast shelves and hidden corners of the main floor.<br><strong>Atmosphere of Wealth and Decay</strong> \u2013 Experience the eerie elegance of a rich man\u2019s library after dark.<br><strong>Full Release Awaits</strong> \u2013 The second floor and basement\u2014with expanded dangers and secrets\u2014will unlock in the complete game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This demo is an early look at the experience. The game is still under development and will continue to improve leading up to full release.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982710?t=1758741030","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982710?t=1758741030","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982710/72e4137cdaee28150850394c33352412e1cf92dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758741030","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982710/72e4137cdaee28150850394c33352412e1cf92dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758741030","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Optio